00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:22.122
These are the things I
was told and these are the

00:11:22.122 --> 00:11:24.582
things that by golly I really believe

00:11:24.582 --> 00:11:27.281
and it wasn't until I forgave my dad,

00:11:27.281 --> 00:11:29.945
changed the tape of what
was rolling in my head

00:11:29.945 --> 00:11:32.240
that I no longer acted like a fat person

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:33.848
because if you think you're fat,

00:11:33.848 --> 00:11:35.129
what will you do?

00:11:35.129 --> 00:11:36.613
Come on.

00:11:36.613 --> 00:11:38.863
As a man thinks, so is she.

00:11:41.386 --> 00:11:44.051
As you think, so are you.

00:11:44.051 --> 00:11:47.482
So I saw myself fat, I
spoke like I was fat.

00:11:47.482 --> 00:11:49.496
Do I look fat in this.

00:11:49.496 --> 00:11:51.079
Is my butt too big.

00:11:52.599 --> 00:11:56.850
Man, I'm so fat, I have
this, I have that, right?

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:58.563
So when you think like that,

00:11:58.563 --> 00:12:01.276
